        {
          "text": "Alimwi silutwe wacisi nayanda kubambila Jehova cipaizyo camoyo wakwe mwini, neciba cituuzyo neciba cipaizyo cakutontozya, lino uyoojulilwa mulyango uulangide kujwe. Uyoobamba zituuzyo zyakwe na zipaizyo zyakwe zyakutontozya mbubonya mbuli mbwacita mubuzuba bwa-Sabata. Amana, ulazwa, elyo mulyango ulajalwa musule lyakwe,",
          "type": "text",
